---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro'
import EarlyAccessForm from '../components/EarlyAccessForm.astro'
import { site } from '../site'
import { softwareApplication } from '../schema'

const { monthly, yearly, yearlyFull } = site.pricing

const title = 'Pricing | Klaroly booking software for makeup artists'
const description = `Klaroly is in development. Early access pricing is £${monthly} a month, or £${yearly} a year instead of £${yearlyFull}. One price with everything in it, and a free trial.`

const muted = 'text-[var(--color-muted)]'
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} schema={[softwareApplication(true)]}>
  <PageHeader title="Pricing">
    Klaroly is not open yet, so this is what is planned rather than what you
    can buy today. We would rather say that plainly than put a fake button on
    a page.
  </PageHeader>

  <div
    class="mt-10 max-w-2xl rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-line)] p-6 sm:p-8"
  >
    <p class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
      £{monthly} <span class:list={['text-xl font-normal', muted]}>a month</span>
    </p>
    <p class:list={['mt-2 text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed', muted]}>
      One price, everything in it. No per-booking fee, no commission on what
      your clients pay you, no percentage of your wedding season.
    </p>

    <hr class="my-7 border-[var(--color-line)]" />

    <p class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1">
      <span class="sr-only">Normally</span>
      <s class:list={['text-2xl sm:text-3xl', muted]}>£{yearlyFull}</s>
      <span class="sr-only">, early access price</span>
      <span
        class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--color-accent)] sm:text-4xl"
        >£{yearly}</span
      >
      <span class:list={['text-xl', muted]}>a year</span>
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[1.0625rem] font-medium">
      Early access price, held after launch.
    </p>
    <p class:list={['mt-2 text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed', muted]}>
      That is the deal, and it is the reason to join now. Pay for the year up
      front, help us finish it, and you keep that price.
    </p>

    <p class:list={['mt-6 text-xs', muted]}>Plus local taxes where applicable.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="prose max-w-2xl">
    <p class="mt-8">
      There will be a free trial, long enough to put a real booking through it
      rather than just click around.
    </p>

    <h2>Why one price</h2>
    <p>
      Tiered pricing on a tool like this usually means the useful half sits
      behind the expensive tier and you spend your first month working out
      which one you are. We would rather charge one fair price and let you get
      on with it.
    </p>

    <h2>What early access gets you</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>An extended free trial</li>
      <li>Free use of the beta while we finish it</li>
      <li>Your early access price held after launch</li>
      <li>A say in what gets built next</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>About your clients' money</h2>
    <p>
      Klaroly takes nothing from what your clients pay you. Your fees are
      yours. The subscription is the only money that comes to us.
    </p>
  </div>

  <EarlyAccessForm id="pricing" class="mt-2" />
</BaseLayout>
